          }
        },
        {
          "text": "A collection compact operation covers the collection and its associated indexes. Because collection storageSize excludes indexes, that single metric is insufficient to describe the operation's complete storage footprint. (medium confidence) Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/compact.md ; https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/collStats.md",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/compact.md",
          "note": null,
