        },
        {
          "text": "For a collection-level internal-free-space ratio, compare freeStorageSize with storageSize using consistent units. This ratio describes internal capacity; it does not describe where free blocks lie or guarantee a reclaimable-byte total. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/mongodb/use-cases/defragment-a-disk-to-improve-disk-usage",
